// Pure-Cedar reads of principal entity attributes of every core type, to
// exercise the Value -> Cedar RestrictedExpression conversion and Cedar schema
// conformance for each type (Long, Bool, decimal, Set<String>) — the attribute
// values are supplied per event via the `.log` entities(...) envelope.
//
// The four conjuncts each read one type; a trace flips exactly one condition
// per timepoint, so the verdict stream isolates whether each type round-trips.

permit (
    principal,
    action == Drupe::Action::"Read",
    resource
)
when {
    principal.level >= 3
    && principal.active == true
    && principal.score.greaterThan(decimal("0.5"))
    && principal.roles.contains("admin")
};
